name: "Ledgerline Payroll — payroll software for small businesses, United States"
identity:
  category: Payroll software company
  place: online; serves the United States
  status: operating
  record_built: 2026-11-05
what_it_does:
  text: "Ledgerline Payroll sells online payroll software for small businesses in the United States with 1–50 employees. It runs payroll, pays staff by direct deposit, files federal and state payroll taxes, and moves a company's year-to-date payroll over from another provider. It works fully online and has no office open to visitors."
  customers_served: small businesses with 1–50 employees
  how_it_serves: online
  countries_served: United States
services:
  items[7]:
    - name: Core payroll plan
      price: USD 39 per month plus USD 6 per employee (as of 2026-11-05)
      includes: unlimited pay runs; direct deposit; federal and state tax filing; W-2 and 1099 forms
    - name: Time tracking add-on
      price: USD 3 per employee per month (as of 2026-11-05)
    - Payroll processing
    - Direct deposit
    - Federal and state payroll tax filing
    - W-2 and 1099 forms
    - Time-tracking integration
  integrations: "QuickBooks Online, Xero"
  services_listed_on_the_business_s_website: "https://ledgerline.example/features"
